  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/400/the_twilight_forest.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模組概述</strong></h2><p>本模組使暮光森林與動態樹木兼容，新增了暮光森林中所有樹木的動態生長版本，並在暮光森林維度的世界生成中完全替換原有樹木。<br>這些樹木的外觀、行為及生成方式均可透過樹木包進行自訂調整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>功能特色</strong></h2><h4><strong>目前已包含的樹種：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>病態暮光橡木</li>\n<li>強健暮光橡木</li>\n<li>樹冠樹</li>\n<li>紅樹</li>\n<li>彩虹橡樹</li>\n<li>黑木樹</li>\n<li>時間之樹</li>\n<li>蛻變之樹</li>\n<li>分類樹</li>\n<li>礦工樹</li>\n</ul><h4><strong><br>世界生成：&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>暮光森林維度中所有生態域現已生成動態樹木。<br>此設定可透過樹木包進行調整。<br><br></p><h4><strong>魔法樹木：&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>時間之樹、蛻變之樹、分類樹及礦工樹皆具完整功能，能觸發各自特殊效果。欲取得魔法種子，請使用泥土桶配方轉換樹苗。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他擴充模組</strong></h2><p>其他模組的動態樹木擴充可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 動態樹木CurseForge頁面</a>找到。</p><h4><strong>建議與請求：</strong></h4><p>若欲請求新增模組兼容性，請至此提交！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需求條件</strong></h2><h5>(1.16.5 / 1.18.2)</h5><h6>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>歡迎自由使用於任何模組包！無需詢問。<br>本模組採用<strong>MIT</strong>授權，原始碼公開於GitHub。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>",
